Added a Themes control panel for managing named themes, where a theme can be edited, duplicated from an existing one, or deleted — the default theme can be edited like any other, only its deletion is refused. The selected theme is applied by overriding the colour custom properties for the whole page; it is read from the `@inherit` expander, so a section inherits the closest theme set above it, and unsaved edits are previewed live while the form is open. @ericof
